  "body": "a19be4585 (vantiboolean on Discord) made the Routing page show a request in flight with motion reduced (the system's or Settings'): the flowing wires and the held dot fade instead of standing still.\n\nThe tray panel's own small stage (client.js pPlay/pTick, routing.css .ps-*/.pr-*) was left as it was: with motion reduced, pPlay returns at once (no dot), and the reduce block turns off .pr-req.wait .pr-to > i, .ps-hub.busy, .ps-dot.wait and .ps-dst.wait > i::after. So a request in flight there looks like one that is over. The opacity-only ps-wait fades could stay on under reduce, and the scale pulses (rtlive, ps-ring) could become fades, as the page now does.",
  "closed_by": null,
